      "text": [
        ": «إِنَّ بِلاَلاً كَانَ عَبْداً صَالِحاً فَقَالَ لاَ أُؤَذِّنُ لِأَحَدٍ بَعْدَ رَسُولِ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ فَتُرِكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ حَيَّ عَلَى خَيْرِ اَلْعَمَلِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.872 - Abu Basir narrated from one of the Imams (as) that He said:\n\"Bilal was a righteous servant who said:\n'I will not call the adhan for anyone after the Messenger of Allah (sw).'\nTherefore, on that day, 'Hayya 'ala khayr al-'Amal' (Hasten to the best of deeds) was left out.\""
        ]
      }
